      "releaseNotes": {
        "highlights": {
          "zh": [
            "支持 UE 5.4.4–5.8.4。",
            "soloAS 菜单新增「关于 soloAS」「检查更新」与一键更新。"
          ],
          "en": [
            "Supports UE 5.4.4–5.8.4.",
            "The soloAS menu adds About soloAS, Check for updates, and one-click updating."
          ]
        },
        "changelog": {
          "zh": "https://soloas.cuviss.com/docs/zh/changelog.html",
          "en": "https://soloas.cuviss.com/docs/en/changelog.html"
        }
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": [
          "UE 兼容版本支持：UE 5.4.4、UE 5.5.4、UE 5.6.1、UE 5.7.4、UE 5.8.4。",
          "AS 脚本 API 完善：以 UE 5.8.4 时期 UE-AS fork 的 AS 插件为基准，修复少数不常用接口的细节差异；原生函数非空 FName 默认值等上游缺陷按修复后的行为提供。",
          "UE 旧版本与最新版的适配区别：详见「不同 UE 版本的适配差异」。",
          "soloAS 菜单新增「关于 soloAS」「检查更新」与一键更新（保留插件内用户配置，失败自动回滚）。"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Supported UE versions: UE 5.4.4, UE 5.5.4, UE 5.6.1, UE 5.7.4, and UE 5.8.4.",
          "AS scripting API improvements: based on the UE 5.8.4-era AS plugin from the UE-AS fork, details of a few rarely used interfaces have been aligned; upstream defects such as non-empty FName defaults are corrected.",
          "Differences between adapting older UE versions and the latest version: see “UE Version Differences”.",
          "The soloAS menu adds About soloAS, Check for updates, and one-click updating, preserving user settings inside plugins and automatically rolling back on failure."
        ]
      },
      "fixes": {
        "zh": [
          "修复导出脚本文档后编辑器关闭时可能发生崩溃的问题。",
          "修复脚本类继承 Widget 或动画蓝图时，蓝图设计器或动画图功能可能缺失的问题。",
          "修复热重载后调试服务器查询函数信息时可能发生崩溃的问题。",
          "修复 macOS 编辑器中脚本类重定向识别异常的问题（仅影响 macOS）。",
          "修复脚本省略原生函数的非空 FName 默认参数时可能传入空名称的问题。",
          "修复调用原生函数时，引用与输出参数未直接传递调用方地址、非 const 裸引用参数的输入值丢失，可能导致 df58 等工程崩溃的问题（0.1.2 也受影响）。"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Fixed a possible editor crash on exit after exporting script documentation.",
          "Fixed possible loss of the Blueprint Designer or animation graph when scripting classes inherit from Widget or animation Blueprints.",
          "Fixed possible debug server crashes when querying function information after hot reload.",
          "Fixed script class redirect recognition in the macOS editor (macOS only).",
          "Fixed omitted non-empty FName default arguments on native functions being passed as empty names.",
          "Fixed native function calls not passing reference and output arguments at the caller’s address and losing input values for non-const bare references, which could crash projects such as df58 (also affects 0.1.2)."
        ]
      },
      "checksumAsset": "SHA256SUMS"
    },
